<section class="home_about image">
    <div class="container width-container">
        <h1 class="block_text">Founded in 2011 by the 140-year-old JK Group, JK Lakshmipat University (JKLU) continues JK's legacy of excellence and commitment to nation-building.</h1>
<p>Accredited with an 'A' grade by NAAC, JKLU is at the forefront of innovation, blending academia with industry through its interdisciplinary programs in engineering, management, and design that prepare students to excel in an ever-evolving workspace.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://jklu.edu.in/about-us/vision-mission"> Vision &amp; Mission <svg id="Arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24"> <g id="Group_1500" data-name="Group 1500" transform="translate(7 7.999)"> <g id="Group_9379" data-name="Group 9379"> <path id="Path_756" data-name="Path 756" d="M-9228.237-15314.04l4.22,4.219-4.22,4.22" transform="translate(9232.928 15314.04)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></path> <line id="Line_237" data-name="Line 237" x1="8.4" transform="translate(0 4.247)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></line> </g> </g> <g id="Ellipse_17" data-name="Ellipse 17" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" stroke="none"></circle> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11.5" fill="none"></circle> </g> </svg> </a></li>
<li><a href="https://jklu.edu.in/about-us/leadership-governance"> Leadership &amp; Governance<svg id="Arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24"> <g id="Group_1500" data-name="Group 1500" transform="translate(7 7.999)"> <g id="Group_9379" data-name="Group 9379"> <path id="Path_756" data-name="Path 756" d="M-9228.237-15314.04l4.22,4.219-4.22,4.22" transform="translate(9232.928 15314.04)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></path> <line id="Line_237" data-name="Line 237" x1="8.4" transform="translate(0 4.247)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></line> </g> </g> <g id="Ellipse_17" data-name="Ellipse 17" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" stroke="none"></circle> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11.5" fill="none"></circle> </g> </svg> </a></li>
<li><a href="https://jklu.edu.in/about-us/rankings-accreditations"> Rankings &amp; Accreditations <svg id="Arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24"> <g id="Group_1500" data-name="Group 1500" transform="translate(7 7.999)"> <g id="Group_9379" data-name="Group 9379"> <path id="Path_756" data-name="Path 756" d="M-9228.237-15314.04l4.22,4.219-4.22,4.22" transform="translate(9232.928 15314.04)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></path> <line id="Line_237" data-name="Line 237" x1="8.4" transform="translate(0 4.247)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></line> </g> </g> <g id="Ellipse_17" data-name="Ellipse 17" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" stroke="none"></circle> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11.5" fill="none"></circle> </g> </svg> </a></li>
<li><a href="https://jklu.edu.in/about-us/milestones"> Milestones <svg id="Arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24"> <g id="Group_1500" data-name="Group 1500" transform="translate(7 7.999)"> <g id="Group_9379" data-name="Group 9379"> <path id="Path_756" data-name="Path 756" d="M-9228.237-15314.04l4.22,4.219-4.22,4.22" transform="translate(9232.928 15314.04)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></path> <line id="Line_237" data-name="Line 237" x1="8.4" transform="translate(0 4.247)" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"></line> </g> </g> <g id="Ellipse_17" data-name="Ellipse 17" fill="none" stroke="" stroke-width="1"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" stroke="none"></circle> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11.5" fill="none"></circle> </g> </svg></a></li>
