                        Excellence & <br> Nation Building</h2>
                    <blockquote class="block_text" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="500" data-aos-delay="350">
                        <img src="https://jklu.edu.in/siteassets/images/icons/quote-top.webp" class="top-quote" alt="quote" width="24" height="24">
                        We, as an industrial conglomerate, have been steadfastly committed to education and meritocracy in the country for more than 140 years. We challenge our students to explore new ideas and perspectives, think critically and creatively, and embrace innovation and entrepreneurship.                        <img loading="lazy" src="https://jklu.edu.in/siteassets/images/icons/quote-bottom.webp" class="bottom-quote"
